itle=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section2.6, p.43, DjVu scan58"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书仅概述自然数理论上的可定义查询；以下分层语法为明确标注的本地重构"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arithmetic-hierarchy-—-算术层级-$\\Sigma_n^0,-\\Pi_n^0$\">df-arithmetic-hierarchy — 算术层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{ArithFml}\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\)</span>。下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\rm ar}\">\\(\\tau_{\\rm ar}\\)</span> 是无限自然数算术的有限词汇，不使用有限数值结构的截断加法关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\)</span>、项变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 使用所列上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 是有限且分量互异的变量序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}\\)</span> 为其坐标集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为序列连接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B_Q\">\\(\\mathsf B_Q\\)</span> 是下式递归构造的量词块，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\\)</span> 为下式给出的无限结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}\\)</span> 和满足关系允许任意非空结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AH}\">\\(\\mathrm{AH}\\)</span> 保留为语法片段并集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AHRel}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{AHRel}_k\\)</span> 是元语言中自然数关系的可定义性类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s,\\mathsf{add}_{\\rm ar},\\mathsf{mul}_{\\rm ar}\\in\\mathsf F\">\\(\\mathsf s,\\mathsf{add}_{\\rm ar},\\mathsf{mul}_{\\rm ar}\\in\\mathsf F\\)</span>，元数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,2,2\">\\(1,2,2\\)</span>；它们不同于有限数值词汇中的三元加法、乘法关系符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\in\\mathsf R\">\\(&lt;\\in\\mathsf R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(&lt;)=2\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(&lt;)=2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf C\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{add}_{\\rm ar},\\mathsf{mul}_{\\rm ar}\">\\(\\mathsf{add}_{\\rm ar},\\mathsf{mul}_{\\rm ar}\\)</span> 的解释分别为自然数加法、乘法。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\rm ar}\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},0,\\mathsf s^{(1)},\\mathsf{add}_{\\rm ar}^{(2)},\\mathsf{mul}_{\\rm ar}^{(2)}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,&lt;,0,(u\\mapsto u+1),+,\\times\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{\\rm ar}\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},0,\\mathsf s^{(1)},\\mathsf{add}_{\\rm ar}^{(2)},\\mathsf{mul}_{\\rm ar}^{(2)}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,&lt;,0,(u\\mapsto u+1),+,\\times\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\subseteq D,\\\\&amp;\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\phi\\lor\\psi)\\in D^3,\\\\&amp;\\forall\\phi\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\left(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}(t)\\to(\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\phi),\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\phi))\\in D^2\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_0^0\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\subseteq D,\\\\&amp;\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\phi\\lor\\psi)\\in D^3,\\\\&amp;\\forall\\phi\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\left(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\tau_{\\rm ar}}(t)\\to(\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\phi),\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\phi))\\in D^2\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B_Q(\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\mathsf B_Q(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown\\bar y,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\mathsf B_Q(\\bar y,\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf B_Q(\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\mathsf B_Q(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown\\bar y,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\mathsf B_Q(\\bar y,\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf B_\\exists(\\bar x,\\phi)\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=|\\bar x|,\\ \\phi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\},\\quad\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf B_\\forall(\\bar x,\\phi)\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=|\\bar x|,\\ \\phi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf B_\\exists(\\bar x,\\phi)\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=|\\bar x|,\\ \\phi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\},\\quad\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf B_\\forall(\\bar x,\\phi)\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=|\\bar x|,\\ \\phi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AH}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^0\\cup\\Pi_n^0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AH}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^0\\cup\\Pi_n^0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AHRel}_k\\coloneqq\\left\\{S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists\\phi\\in\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar})\\;((\\beta(x_1),\\ldots,\\beta(x_k))\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AHRel}_k\\coloneqq\\left\\{S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists\\phi\\in\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar})\\;((\\beta(x_1),\\ldots,\\beta(x_k))\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_{\\rm ar}\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书第2.6节印刷43页、扫描58，将算术层级概述为自然数一阶理论可描述的布尔查询类；没有在该处给出本条全部分层语法。ArithFml、有限量词块、 bounded 基底和 AH 的具体语法是本地重构，AHRel 另外记录原书强调的语义可定义关系，不能把语法树集合直接等同于关系集合。</p>\n<p>有界量词已展开为普通 FO 公式；界项不得含被绑定变量。最小闭包存在，因为 ArithFml 自身满足闭包条件；量词块递归按序列长度，层级递归按自然数，均唯一确定。空块允许下层语法嵌入上层。本条不额外断言语法并集字面等于全部一阶公式，也不在此给出层级严格性或前束范式的证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy-—-算术层级-$\\Sigma_n^0,-\\Pi_n^0$","text":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — 算术层级 $\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0$","level":1},{"id":"Hypot